license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ashraful388/AgentBetta"
url: "https://github.com/ashraful388/AgentBetta"
abstract: >-
  AgentBetta is an adaptive AI nano-agent that configures its model, context,
  tools, permissions, memory and computational budgets for each task, verifies
  the outcome with a runtime validator, and selectively expands only the
  configuration dimensions that were insufficient.
